<title>POLAND: Polish Handlowy institutional tranche underwritten.</title>
<headline>Polish Handlowy institutional tranche underwritten.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Issuer:				    Bank Handlowy SA</p>
<p> Total Issue Size :		     19,500,000</p>
<p> Issue Type:				common shares,</p>
<p>						institutional tranche</p>
<p> Price (PLN):			     35</p>
<p> Underwriter:			    SHARES UNDERWRITTEN</p>
<p> J. Henry Schroder &amp; Co Ltd	  6,825,000</p>
<p> JP Morgan Securities Ltd	    6,825,000</p>
<p> Goldman Sachs International	 1,560,000</p>
<p> Merrill Lynch International	 1,560,000</p>
<p> UBS Limited			     1,560,000</p>
<p> Daiwa Europe Limited		    585,000</p>
<p> Dresdner Europe Limited		 585,000</p>
<p>NOTE: No details on a stand-by fee were provided.</p>
<p>The bank has said 3.9 million shares from the tranche would be issued as Global Depositary Receipts (GDRs).</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
